// This source pays session bisimilarity with a univalence between nominal types.
//
// The univalence record supplies the evidence.
// Native identity checks the evidence at the owed payload pair.
// `equiv` decides a path from its round trips.
//
// `oneProtocol` gives `Path.bisim` the payload path.
//
// - see: `model/identity/equiv-data.gandr` — `equiv` checks round trips
// - see: #1739 — `oneProtocol`

// The bits and the answers, their univalence `codes`, and the protocols
// `Ask.Coded` and `Ask.Decoded` that hear them.
import "./run-transport.gandr";

/// The two protocols are one type along the univalence, which pays
/// the one pair of payloads that differ.
def oneProtocol : Path[.A = Type](
  Ask.Coded,
  Ask.Decoded
) = Path.bisim Ask.Coded Ask.Decoded codes;
